### Day 2~3 · Prometheus + node_exporter + Grafana

작업 폴더 구조
```
week1/
├── docker-compose.yml
├── prometheus/
│   ├── prometheus.yml
│   └── alert-rules.yml
└── alertmanager/
    └── alertmanager.yml
```

`docker-compose.yml`
```yaml
services:
  prometheus:
    image: prom/prometheus:latest
    volumes:
      - ./prometheus:/etc/prometheus
      - prom-data:/prometheus
    ports: ["9090:9090"]

  node-exporter:
    image: prom/node-exporter:latest
    pid: host
    volumes:
      - /proc:/host/proc:ro
      - /sys:/host/sys:ro
    command:
      - --path.procfs=/host/proc
      - --path.sysfs=/host/sys
    ports: ["9100:9100"]

  grafana:
    image: grafana/grafana:latest
    ports: ["3000:3000"]
    volumes:
      - grafana-data:/var/lib/grafana

